**Table of Contents**

**1. Executive Summary**

SpendWise is a personal expense-tracking iOS application designed to
give individuals clear, real-time visibility into their monthly
spending. The app centres on an intuitive shop-based categorisation
model: users define the shops they regularly visit, assign them custom
icons and brand colours, and then log each purchase against a specific
shop.

Two primary tabs drive the experience:

-   Shops Tab --- a grid dashboard showing all user-defined shops and a
    live badge indicating how much has been spent at each shop in the
    current month.

-   Analytics Tab --- a monthly summary view displaying total spending
    across all shops, a fund-utilisation progress bar, and a predictive
    burn-rate chart that estimates when the monthly budget will be
    exhausted.

The product targets budget-conscious individuals --- students, young
professionals, and households --- who want a lightweight, visual
alternative to spreadsheet-based budgeting.

**2. Goals & Success Metrics**

**2.1 Product Goals**

-   Enable users to create and manage a personal catalogue of shops in
    under 60 seconds.

-   Provide instant at-a-glance spending awareness through badge counts
    on shop icons.

-   Give users proactive budget control via monthly fund allocation and
    burn-rate projection.

-   Deliver a delightful, gesture-driven native iOS experience with zero
    mandatory sign-up.

